abstract: >-
  Post-processing code for orientation statistics of non-spherical granular
  particles under simple shear from LAMMPS/Liggghts DEM simulations:
  orientation distributions, nematic order, Maier-Saupe/ODF fits,
  Jeffrey-orbit comparison, and rotational diffusion.
keywords:
  - granular matter
  - discrete element method
  - orientation distribution
  - nematic order
  - simple shear
